## Rule: team-20260504000000-fix001
# Trigger: writing git commit messages
git commit -m 'fix(scope): describe what and why'
# Reason: Vague commit messages make git history unreadable and block bisect.

## Rule: team-20260504000000-fix002
# Trigger: writing database tests
use an in-process SQLite or test container instead
# Reason: Mocking the DB hides schema drift and production-only bugs.

## Rule: team-20260504000000-fix003
# Trigger: handling API keys or tokens in code
read from process.env.API_KEY; never hardcode credentials
# Reason: Hardcoded secrets get committed to git and leaked.

## Rule: team-20260504000000-fix004
# Trigger: opening a pull request
fetch Codex bot comments after every PR; loop until silent or thumbs-up
# Reason: Codex catches issues CI misses; ignoring it ships known problems.

## Rule: team-20260504000000-fix005
# Trigger: adding logic to packages/core
keep core pure — no fs/child_process imports; inject IO via parameters
# Reason: Functional core enables deterministic tests without mocks or filesystem.

## Rule: pers-20260504103739-hw7m1n
# Trigger: 接收来自 teammate 的消息，尤其是 teammate-message 标签标记的任务状态更新时
立即识别 teammate-message 作为任务完成/失败/阻塞信号，读取内容推进工作流，不要继续报告该 agent 为 idle 或等待中
# Reason: Multi-agent 系统中，teammate-message 是异步完成信号的关键载体，错误忽视会导致流程虚假阻塞和丧失并行优势；应主动识别并即刻处理而非被动等待通知

## Rule: pers-20260504103854-lok1li
# Trigger: 多个并行 Wave 任务在进行中，某个 teammate 已发送完成反馈或结果
立即读取已回报的结果（通过消息或文件），评估并推进下一步；不要说'等待'或被动轮询
# Reason: 并行任务的反馈通常会以 teammate message 或结果文件形式主动送达；AI 应该识别完成信号并立即处理，而非被动说'等待'，否则浪费异步并行性且延误工作流推进

## Rule: pers-20260504103859-nu5kzy
# Trigger: 异步并行任务中收到某项工作的失败结果（如 exit_code!=0）
收到失败 verdict 时立即识别为关键阻塞，停止被动等待，转入问题修复流程
# Reason: 异步工作流中失败信号应当立即被识别和处理，而不是被动继续等待其他任务；及时响应失败信号避免关键问题延迟处理

